@startuml
[*] --> WaitingCustomer

state "Waiting for customer" as WaitingCustomer
state "Recording items" as RecordItems
state "Waiting for payment" as WaitingPayment
state "Sale completed" as SaleComplete

WaitingCustomer --> RecordItems : enter item
RecordItems --> RecordItems : enter item
RecordItems --> WaitingPayment : end of sale
WaitingPayment --> SaleComplete : cash paid
WaitingPayment --> WaitingPayment : card/cheque paid
SaleComplete --> WaitingCustomer : payment finished

note right of RecordItems
The system waits for items to be added one by one.
end note

note right of WaitingPayment
If payment is cash, sale completes immediately.
For card or check, payment verification occurs first.
end note
@enduml
